Full-G3 blocker isolation
  The only concrete test error in the full log is outside order-10b:
  test/test_model_evaluation.jl:15 constructs ModelEvaluationRecord without the
  newly mandatory fingerprint_algorithm keyword declared by the untracked
  src/model_evaluation.jl constructor. The runner reports two failed groups,
  but its detailed output contains one errored test set (0 passed, 0 failed,
  1 errored); all other printed groups, including functional markers 60/60,
  finite open dynamics 16/16, Lean-Julia contract 1214/1214, category 77/77,
  claim ledger 417/417, and v1 ledger 372/372, pass. These model-evaluation
